  "title": "Week 41: MängudeÖÖ 2026",
  "date": "2026-10-16T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 41: MängudeÖÖ 2026\n\nWhile writing this post, I am in heavy fever. After digiConf I caught cold. I thought I got better, so I went to MängudeÖÖ.\n\nMängudeÖÖ is an Estonia Expo that holds yearly. This year they include a lot VR games.\n\nPuzzeling Places and Ancient Dungeon make talks about their marketing experience. Turns out, there are 20% of people are 65+ playing puzzeling places.\n\npuzzel land\n\nAncient Dungeon\n\nmarketing\n\nI also played UnLoop from CM games. In this game, you copy yourself to solve puzzels.\n\nI played White Phosphorus: An Explosive Escape, a game made by TLU's students, one of the maker is also from China.\n\nChicks on the menu, a 1v1 hide and sick game.\n\nMachine Party, A multiplayer battle royale game.\n\nI could not finish all the events. As the fever got worse. I still have one workshop from iGame project wanted to attend. Maybe next time.\n\nAlso, come and play the our game, Grandpa's Bee Haven.\n\nGrandpa's bee haven",
